      lines: ['SINCE + MỐC', 'I’ve lived here since 2020.', 'since Monday / since last summer', 'since I moved here', 'How long have you lived here?', 'Since 2020.', 'FOR + KHOẢNG', 'I’ve lived here for six years.', 'for two weeks / for a long time', 'I’ve known her for five years.', 'How long have you known her?', 'For five years.', 'Khoảng đã kết thúc: I lived there for two years, then I moved. FOR không tự buộc dùng HAVE.'],
      dialogue: null,
      notes: 'Lately especially common with present perfect and perfect continuous; avoid I did it lately as the standard productive model. Recently also appears with past simple: I bought a camera recently.',
