      lines: ['Have you bought anything useful recently?', 'I’ve bought a small camera.', 'Have you tried anything new lately?', 'I’ve tried a pottery workshop.', 'Have you heard from an old friend lately?', 'No, I haven’t heard from her lately.', 'Have you had any problems recently?', 'I’ve had a problem with my booking.', 'RECENTLY dùng được với quá khứ đơn. LATELY thường nhìn khoảng gần đây đến hiện tại.'],
      dialogue: null,
