      title: 'A booking mistake · Check', instruction: 'Trả lời trước, sau đó tìm câu trong hội thoại làm bằng chứng.',
      lines: ['What mistake has Mai made?', 'She chose the wrong date.', 'Has she called the hotel yet?', 'No. Not yet.', 'What did Ben do last month?', 'Called and changed the date.', 'When did Ben last stay at this hotel?', 'In June.', 'Đóng lời thoại và kể lại 3 thông tin bạn nhớ.'],
      dialogue: null,
      notes: 'Read twice in clear American English at 105–120 words per minute. Keep script hidden until the first retell. Answers: herself and Mai / pottery / no, Mai wants painting; six years / 2021; last Saturday / Lan / Mai; twice / price of new evening class. SCRIPT: Hi, I’m Lan. I’ve lived in Da Nang for six years, and I’ve known my friend Mai since 2021. We’ve tried several new activities together, but I’ve never joined a painting class. Last Saturday, we went to a pottery workshop near the river. I booked it online on Thursday, and Mai paid for our tickets the next day. At the workshop, the teacher showed us how to make a bowl. My first bowl was very small, but I was happy with it. I’ve tried pottery twice so far, and I’ve already booked another session. Mai hasn’t made a decision yet because she wants to try painting instead. We’ve just received a message from the studio. They’ve added a new evening class, but we haven’t checked the price yet. I’ve kept the bowl from last Saturday on my desk. Every time I see it, I remember our afternoon together. Have you tried anything new lately?',
